---
import Heading from "@components/ui/Heading.astro";
---

<section class="about-container mb-15">
    <div class="heading">
        <Heading number={2} text="About Me" />
    </div>
    <div class="graphic">
        
    </div>
    <div class="text text-xl font-body text-text-secondary pt-2">
        <p>
            I'm Samuel, a <span class="text-accent">Software Engineer</span> from Panama focused on building
            systems that make an impact. I graduated from Universidad
            Tecnológica de Panamá and currently working in Business Intelligence
            at Banco Delta, using Microsoft Fabric, Azure and <span class="text-accent">SQL</span> to deliver data
            and KPIs that drive decision-making.
        </p>
        <br>
        <p>
            I enjoy building <span class="text-accent">APIs</span> and <span class="text-accent">web applications</span>, designing systems and
            integrating services to create scalable and efficient solutions, working
            with technologies like <span class="text-accent">Python</span>, <span class="text-accent">JavaScript</span> and <span class="text-accent">React</span>. I like solving
            complex problems and turning them into structured, reliable solutions.
        </p>
        <br>
        <p>
            I'm a self-learner at heart, always exploring new technologies and
            improving my skills across backend, modern web development, and
            the recent game-changer, <span class="text-accent">AI</span>. Outside of work, I’m into setups, gaming
            and the gym. I also enjoy exploring nature — especially rivers, natural
            pools and hidden spots across Panama.
        </p>
        <br>
        <p>
            <span class="font-bold text-text-primary">Let’s build something great.</span>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-container {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 6fr 8fr;
        grid-template-rows: 1fr 3fr;
        gap: 12px;
    }
    .heading { grid-area: 1 / 1 / 2 / 2; }
    .text { grid-area: 1 / 2 / 3 / 3; }
    .graphic { grid-area: 2 / 1 / 3 / 2; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.1); }
</style>